{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 0, "text": "// Player thinks + Make coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 1, "text": "역시 혼자서는 무리야."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 2, "text": "이곳의 미타는 날 공격하지 않았으면 좋겠다…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 3, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 4, "text": "이런 데서 뭐 하고 있는 거야…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 5, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 6, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 7, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 8, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 9, "text": "// Player tries to wake up MitaDreamer"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 10, "text": "미타?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 11, "text": "미타, 일어나봐."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 12, "text": "미타야~"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 13, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 14, "text": "미타, 일어나봐."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 15, "text": "네 도움이 필요해."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 16, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 17, "text": "누구세요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 18, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 19, "text": "스위치만 좀 눌러줘."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 20, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 21, "text": "무슨 스위치요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 22, "text": "조금만 더 잘게요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 23, "text": "아님 커피라도 좀 타주시던가요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 24, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 25, "text": "바로 앞에 있는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 26, "text": "미타?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 27, "text": "미타!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 28, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 29, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 30, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 31, "text": "// Player gives away the coffee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 32, "text": "미타,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 33, "text": "커피 여기 있어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 34, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 35, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 36, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 37, "text": "// MitaDreamer exercise"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 38, "text": "방금…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 39, "text": "스위치라고 하셨나요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 40, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 41, "text": "응."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 42, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 43, "text": "어떻게 알고 계신 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 44, "text": "근데 물어볼 필요도 없겠네요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 45, "text": "여기까지 왔다는 건,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 46, "text": "이미 모든 걸 알고 계시다는 거겠죠."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 47, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 48, "text": "잠시만요,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 49, "text": "좀 앉아 있을게요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 50, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 51, "text": "그래서요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 52, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 53, "text": "어떻게 설명해야 할지 모르겠네."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 54, "text": "확실한 건, 난 여기서 멈추면 안 돼…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 55, "text": "이 반지가 알려주는 길로…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 56, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 57, "text": "그 반지를 가지고 계신 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 58, "text": "그래서…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 59, "text": "여기까지 오실 수 있었던 거군요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 60, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 61, "text": "맞아."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 62, "text": "그러니까 도와줄 수 있어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 63, "text": "스위치만 눌러주면 돼."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 64, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 65, "text": "그럼요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 66, "text": "도와드릴게요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 67, "text": "스위치를…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 68, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 69, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 70, "text": "미타, 또 잠들었어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 71, "text": "얼른 가자."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 72, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 73, "text": "네?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 74, "text": "좋아요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 75, "text": "가시죠…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 76, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 77, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 78, "text": "// MitaDreamer fall"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 79, "text": "정신 좀 차려."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 80, "text": "그렇게 졸려?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 81, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 82, "text": "// MitaDreamer again sleep"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 83, "text": "제발 좀 일어나."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 84, "text": "이제 다 왔다고…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 85, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 86, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 87, "text": "// Switches"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 88, "text": "알겠어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 89, "text": "전 준비됐어요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 90, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 91, "text": "나도 준비됐어."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 92, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 93, "text": "음…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 94, "text": "그럼 제가"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 95, "text": "카운트다운 할게요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 96, "text": "그리고 같이 스위치를 누르는 거예요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 97, "text": "알~겠~죠?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 98, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 99, "text": "그냥 다시 잠들지만 마."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 100, "text": "카운트 시작해."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 101, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 102, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 103, "text": "3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 104, "text": "2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 105, "text": "1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 106, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 107, "text": "// Player lose 1"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 108, "text": "뭐 하시는 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 109, "text": "음…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 110, "text": "한 번 더 해볼까요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 111, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 112, "text": "// Player lose 2"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 113, "text": "한 번 더 할까요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 114, "text": "조금만 더 하면 되는데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 115, "text": "근데…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 116, "text": "눈이 너무 무거워…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 117, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 118, "text": "// Player lose 3"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 119, "text": "저 진짜 졸려요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 120, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 121, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 122, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 123, "text": "좋았어!"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 124, "text": "고마워, 미타."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 125, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 126, "text": "음냐…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 127, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 128, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 129, "text": "왜 이렇게"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 130, "text": "느리죠…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 131, "text": "이 큰 문은…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 132, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 133, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 134, "text": "전 이만 자러 갈게요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 135, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 136, "text": "// Why kitchen?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 137, "text": "왜 여기로 온 거예요?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 138, "text": "차가운 주방 바닥에서 제가 잠들면,"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 139, "text": "다 당신 탓이에요."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 140, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 141, "text": "// Why bathroom?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 142, "text": "이해가 안 돼요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 143, "text": "왜 굳이 여기서 스위치를 누르는 건지…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 144, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 145, "text": "// Put button"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 146, "text": "아무 일도 안 일어나네?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 147, "text": "무슨 버튼이지?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 148, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 149, "text": "// Cofee"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 150, "text": "커피 한 잔 더 마실래?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 151, "text": "또 잠들 것 같은데."}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 152, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 153, "text": "네…?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 154, "text": "됐어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 155, "text": "이 커피 너무 맛없어요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 156, "text": "그만 마실래요…"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 157, "text": ""}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 158, "text": "// Button"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 159, "text": "미타? 버튼이 고장 났어. …듣고 있어?"}
{"category": "LocationDialogue Location17", "line_index": 160, "text": "내 말 듣고 있어?"}
